# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify redirect map
#
# Audit finding H2: Google still indexes pages from the site that preceded the
# Manus build — /about-harrison-saito, /youth-education, /student-testimonies,
# /contact — and every one of them returned HTTP 200 with homepage content and
# no 301. That wasted the old site's link equity, left stale titles in search
# results and generated duplicate-content signals.
#
# These are real 301s, so the equity consolidates onto the new URLs.
#
# Format: <from>  <to>  <status>

# --- legacy pages from the pre-Manus site ---------------------------------
/about-harrison-saito      /about            301
/about-harrison            /about            301
/contact-harrison-saito    /contact          301
/youth-education           /hsc-tutoring     301
/student-testimonies       /testimonials     301
/testimonies               /testimonials     301
/adult-coaching            /mens-coaching    301
/coaching                  /mens-coaching    301
/tutoring                  /hsc-tutoring     301
/hsc                       /hsc-tutoring     301
/services                  /                 301

# --- anchors from the Manus single-page build -----------------------------
# These were #hash targets, so they never hit the server, but anyone who wrote
# them down as paths lands somewhere sensible.
/adults                    /mens-coaching    301
/youth                     /hsc-tutoring     301
/about-me                  /about            301
/media-appearances         /media            301

# --- programme aliases ----------------------------------------------------
/return-to-self            /mens-coaching    301
/returntoself              /mens-coaching    301
/programme                 /mens-coaching    301
/program                   /mens-coaching    301
/apply-now                 /apply            301
/booking                   /book             301
/book-a-call               /book             301
/privacy-policy            /privacy          301
/terms-and-conditions      /terms            301
/terms-of-service          /terms            301

# --- everything else falls through to a real 404 --------------------------
# Closes H8: the old site answered 200 for any URL at all.
/*                         /404.html         404
